        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_02",
          "content": "我很会找到词语来描述自己的感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_03",
          "content": "因为在做白日梦、担心事情或被其他事分心，我没有注意自己正在做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_04",
          "content": "我认为自己的一些想法不正常或不好，觉得不该那样想。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_05",
          "content": "当出现令人苦恼的想法或画面时，我会“退后一步”，觉察它们，而不被它们带着走。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_06",
          "content": "我会注意食物和饮料怎样影响自己的想法、身体感觉和情绪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_07",
          "content": "我很难想到合适的词语，来表达自己对事情的感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_08",
          "content": "我会自动地做事或完成任务，却没有意识到自己正在做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_09",
          "content": "我认为自己的某些情绪不好或不合适，觉得不该有这些感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_10",
          "content": "当出现令人苦恼的想法或画面时，我能够只是注意到它们，而不作出反应。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_11",
          "content": "我会留意一些感觉，比如风吹动头发，或阳光照在脸上的感觉。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_12",
          "content": "即使心烦意乱，我也能找到用语言表达感受的方式。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "ffmq15_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FFMQ15_13",
